1
00:00:00,066 --> 00:00:01,833
觉得我一个人很可怜
juéde wǒ yī gè rén hěn kělián
I think I’m very pitiful being alone

2
00:00:01,833 --> 00:00:04,000
没有朋友也没有孩子
méiyǒu péngyǒu yě méiyǒu háizi
No friends, no children

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,533
然后觉得中国很好啊
ránhòu juéde Zhōngguó hěn hǎo a
Then they think China is great

4
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:06,866
为什么要住在国外
wèishéme yào zhù zài guówài
Why live abroad?

5
00:00:06,866 --> 00:00:10,233
去年我爸爸妈妈是来欧洲旅游
qùnián wǒ bàba māma shì lái Ōuzhōu lǚyóu
Last year my parents came to Europe for a trip

6
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:12,633
其中一个国家就是西班牙
qízhōng yī gè guójiā jiù shì Xībānyá
One of the countries was Spain

7
00:00:12,633 --> 00:00:14,733
巴塞罗那瓦伦西亚
Bāsàiluónà Wǎlúnxīyà
Barcelona and Valencia

8
00:00:14,733 --> 00:00:16,500
他们觉得太美了
tāmen juéde tài měi le
They thought it was so beautiful

9
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:17,600
太漂亮了
tài piàoliang le
Really stunning

10
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,300
生活这么放松啊
shēnghuó zhème fàngsōng a
Life is so relaxing here

11
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:19,833
她说
tā shuō
She said

12
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:23,600
我终于明白为什么你要住在西班牙了
wǒ zhōngyú míngbái wèishéme nǐ yào zhù zài Xībānyá le
I finally understand why you want to live in Spain

13
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:25,500
她说我也很喜欢这里
tā shuō wǒ yě hěn xǐhuān zhèlǐ
She said she also really likes it here

14
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,633
其实我觉得很多传统的父母
qíshí wǒ juéde hěn duō chuántǒng de fùmǔ
Actually, I think many traditional parents

15
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:29,900
可能都有一些共同点
kěnéng dōu yǒu yīxiē gòngtóng diǎn
May have a few things in common

16
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,800
大家好
dàjiā hǎo
Hello everyone

17
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:34,700
欢迎你们来到我们今天这一期播客
huānyíng nǐmen láidào wǒmen jīntiān zhè yī qī bōkè
Welcome to today’s episode of our podcast

18
00:00:34,700 --> 00:00:36,233
今天这个话题
jīntiān zhè ge huàtí
Today’s topic

19
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:39,233
你们一定会觉得非常有意思
nǐmen yīdìng huì juéde fēicháng yǒuyìsi
You will definitely find it very interesting

20
00:00:39,233 --> 00:00:41,333
Suqing我们要聊什么
Suqing wǒmen yào liáo shénme
Suqing, what are we going to talk about?

21
00:00:41,333 --> 00:00:43,833
今天我们想聊一聊
jīntiān wǒmen xiǎng liáo yī liáo
Today we want to talk about

22
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:47,833
有什么东西我们很难和家人分享
yǒu shénme dōngxi wǒmen hěn nán hé jiārén fēnxiǎng
What things are hard to share with our family

23
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:50,266
或者分享了他们也get不到
huòzhě fēnxiǎng le tāmen yě “get” bù dào
Or even if we do, they just don’t get it

24
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:53,333
会觉得说为什么做这样的事情
huì juéde shuō wèishéme zuò zhèyàng de shìqing
They might ask why we’re doing these things

25
00:00:53,333 --> 00:00:58,033
对我们会说有三个方面好
duì wǒmen huì shuō yǒu sān gè fāngmiàn hǎo
We’d say there are three main reasons

26
00:00:58,033 --> 00:00:59,033
那Suqing
nà Suqing
So Suqing

27
00:00:59,033 --> 00:01:02,800
你的妈妈不能get到的第一个点
nǐ de māma bù néng “get” dào de dì yī gè diǎn
What’s the first thing your mom doesn’t get?

28
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:03,900
是什么
shì shénme
What is it?

29
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:08,300
最大的一个点就是为什么住在国外
zuì dà de yí gè diǎn jiùshì wèishéme zhù zài guówài
The biggest one is: why live abroad?

30
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,033
我妈妈和我的姐姐
wǒ māma hé wǒ de jiějie
My mom and sister

31
00:01:10,033 --> 00:01:14,833
都觉得我在国外的生活很不好
dōu juéde wǒ zài guówài de shēnghuó hěn bù hǎo
They both think my life abroad isn’t good

32
00:01:14,833 --> 00:01:16,533
觉得我一个人很可怜
juéde wǒ yí gè rén hěn kělián
They think I’m pitiful being alone

33
00:01:16,533 --> 00:01:19,000
没有朋友也没有孩子
méiyǒu péngyǒu yě méiyǒu háizi
No friends and no kids

34
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,600
然后觉得中国很好啊
ránhòu juéde Zhōngguó hěn hǎo a
And they think China is great

35
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:22,866
为什么要住在国外
wèishéme yào zhù zài guówài
Why live abroad?

36
00:01:22,866 --> 00:01:24,000
明白
míngbái
I see

37
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:27,233
那你是怎么跟他们说的呢
nà nǐ shì zěnme gēn tāmen shuō de ne
So how did you explain it to them?

38
00:01:27,233 --> 00:01:29,866
我就说我在澳大利亚的生活
wǒ jiù shuō wǒ zài Àodàlìyà de shēnghuó
I just said that my life in Australia

39
00:01:29,866 --> 00:01:32,133
是非常非常开心的
shì fēicháng fēicháng kāixīn de
Is extremely happy

40
00:01:32,133 --> 00:01:33,466
但是他们觉得
dànshì tāmen juéde
But they think

41
00:01:33,466 --> 00:01:34,800
你是骗我们的
nǐ shì piàn wǒmen de
You’re lying to us

42
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,533
你不要我们担心
nǐ bú yào wǒmen dānxīn
You just don’t want us to worry

43
00:01:36,533 --> 00:01:38,533
你的家人会说是骗他们的
nǐ de jiārén huì shuō shì piàn tāmen de
Your family says you’re lying to them?

44
00:01:38,533 --> 00:01:39,066
嗯对
èn duì
Yeah, exactly

45
00:01:39,066 --> 00:01:41,666
因为他觉得我是一个好孩子
yīnwèi tā juéde wǒ shì yí gè hǎo háizi
Because they think I’m a good kid

46
00:01:41,666 --> 00:01:43,633
可能我告诉他们我很开心
kěnéng wǒ gàosù tāmen wǒ hěn kāixīn
And maybe I tell them I’m happy

47
00:01:43,633 --> 00:01:47,600
是因为我想要让他们不要担心
shì yīnwèi wǒ xiǎng yào ràng tāmen bú yào dānxīn
Just so they won’t worry

48
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,633
你呢
nǐ ne
What about you?

49
00:01:48,633 --> 00:01:52,466
我的妈妈很久以前也很担心
wǒ de māma hěn jiǔ yǐqián yě hěn dānxīn
My mom used to worry a lot too

50
00:01:52,466 --> 00:01:53,233
先是担心
xiān shì dānxīn
First she was worried

51
00:01:53,233 --> 00:01:56,433
你为什么没有中国的男朋友啊
nǐ wèishéme méiyǒu Zhōngguó de nánpéngyou a
Why don’t you have a Chinese boyfriend?

52
00:01:56,433 --> 00:01:58,666
你在国外也没有人照顾你
nǐ zài guówài yě méiyǒu rén zhàogù nǐ
No one’s taking care of you abroad

53
00:01:58,666 --> 00:02:00,900
生病了怎么办
shēngbìng le zěnme bàn
What if you get sick?

54
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:02,600
她总是说你的
tā zǒngshì shuō nǐ de
She always says

55
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:04,800
最好的朋友的电话是多少
zuì hǎo de péngyǒu de diànhuà shì duōshǎo
What’s your best friend’s phone number?

56
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:06,333
我要找到她
wǒ yào zhǎodào tā
I want to reach her

57
00:02:06,333 --> 00:02:08,066
对对对对
duì duì duì duì
Yes, yes, exactly

58
00:02:08,066 --> 00:02:10,000
所以有时候她找不到我
suǒyǐ yǒu shíhòu tā zhǎo bù dào wǒ
So sometimes when she can’t reach me

59
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,200
我没有回复她
wǒ méiyǒu huífù tā
And I don’t reply to her

60
00:02:11,200 --> 00:02:14,333
她甚至会给我的前男友发信息
tā shènzhì huì gěi wǒ de qián nányǒu fā xìnxī
She’ll even message my ex-boyfriend

61
00:02:14,333 --> 00:02:16,033
你知道Zhifei怎么样了吗
nǐ zhīdào Zhifei zěnme yàng le ma
Do you know how Zhifei is doing?

62
00:02:16,033 --> 00:02:18,066
你可以帮我问问她吗
nǐ kěyǐ bāng wǒ wènwèn tā ma
Can you help me check on her?

63
00:02:18,066 --> 00:02:20,333
就是就是那样子
jiùshì jiùshì nà yàngzi
Yeah, that kind of thing

64
00:02:20,333 --> 00:02:23,133
对但是她很担心
duì dànshì tā hěn dānxīn
Yes, but she’s really worried

65
00:02:23,133 --> 00:02:25,533
她觉得担心我嘛
tā juéde dānxīn wǒ ma
She’s just worried about me

66
00:02:25,533 --> 00:02:27,733
所以她也是觉得
suǒyǐ tā yě shì juéde
So she also feels

67
00:02:27,733 --> 00:02:29,233
你为什么不回国
nǐ wèishéme bù huíguó
Why don’t you come back to China?

68
00:02:29,233 --> 00:02:32,733
中国的经济很好
Zhōngguó de jīngjì hěn hǎo
The Chinese economy is doing great

69
00:02:32,733 --> 00:02:35,466
什么的但是我有一个故事
shénme de dànshì wǒ yǒu yī gè gùshì
And so on—but I have a story

70
00:02:35,466 --> 00:02:40,666
就是去年我爸爸妈妈是来欧洲旅游
jiùshì qùnián wǒ bàba māma shì lái Ōuzhōu lǚyóu
Last year my parents came to travel in Europe

71
00:02:40,666 --> 00:02:43,300
其中一个国家就是西班牙
qízhōng yí gè guójiā jiùshì Xībānyá
One of the countries was Spain

72
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:47,933
他们去了两个我以前生活过的城市
tāmen qù le liǎng gè wǒ yǐqián shēnghuó guò de chéngshì
They visited two cities I used to live in

73
00:02:47,933 --> 00:02:50,866
一个是巴塞罗那
yí gè shì Bāsàiluónà
One was Barcelona

74
00:02:50,866 --> 00:02:53,266
一个是瓦伦西亚
yí gè shì Wǎlúnxīyà
One was Valencia

75
00:02:53,266 --> 00:02:56,733
这个都是他们非常非常喜欢的地方
zhè ge dōu shì tāmen fēicháng fēicháng xǐhuān de dìfāng
They really, really loved these places

76
00:02:56,733 --> 00:02:59,066
他们觉得太美了
tāmen juéde tài měi le
They thought it was beautiful

77
00:02:59,066 --> 00:03:00,900
太漂亮了
tài piàoliang le
So pretty

78
00:03:00,900 --> 00:03:02,833
怎么这么舒服
zěnme zhème shūfú
Why is it so comfortable?

79
00:03:02,833 --> 00:03:05,033
生活这么放松啊
shēnghuó zhème fàngsōng a
Life is so relaxed here

80
00:03:05,033 --> 00:03:08,300
然后我妈妈对我说了一句话
ránhòu wǒ māma duì wǒ shuō le yī jù huà
Then my mom said something to me

81
00:03:08,300 --> 00:03:12,600
她说我终于明白为什么你要住在西班牙了
tā shuō wǒ zhōngyú míngbái wèishéme nǐ yào zhù zài Xībānyá le
She said, I finally understand why you live in Spain

82
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,833
她说我也很喜欢这里
tā shuō wǒ yě hěn xǐhuān zhèlǐ
She said she really likes it here too

83
00:03:14,833 --> 00:03:17,066
那一刻我好开心
nà yí kè wǒ hǎo kāixīn
I was so happy in that moment

84
00:03:17,066 --> 00:03:20,333
但是之前他们都是不能理解的
dànshì zhīqián tāmen dōu shì bù néng lǐjiě de
But before that, they really couldn’t understand

85
00:03:20,333 --> 00:03:22,033
嗯明白
èn míngbái
Mm, I understand

86
00:03:22,033 --> 00:03:24,733
那我有机会也让我的家人来看一看
nà wǒ yǒu jīhuì yě ràng wǒ de jiārén lái kàn yí kàn
Then maybe I’ll also let my family come and see someday

87
00:03:24,733 --> 00:03:26,666
他们会明白
tāmen huì míngbái
They will understand

88
00:03:26,666 --> 00:03:28,400
你不需要说太多
nǐ bù xūyào shuō tài duō
You don’t need to say too much

89
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:31,300
他们喜欢的点不一定是你喜欢的
tāmen xǐhuān de diǎn bù yīdìng shì nǐ xǐhuān de
What they like may not be what you like

90
00:03:31,300 --> 00:03:33,033
但是感受
dànshì gǎnshòu
But the feeling…

91
00:03:33,033 --> 00:03:35,466
你让他们去自己去感受
nǐ ràng tāmen zìjǐ qù gǎnshòu
You let them go and feel it themselves

92
00:03:35,466 --> 00:03:38,100
明白
míngbái
Got it

93
00:03:38,100 --> 00:03:39,500
第二点是什么
dì èr diǎn shì shénme
What’s the second point?

94
00:03:39,500 --> 00:03:43,866
就是家人不能明白我们的点是什么
jiùshì jiārén bù néng míngbái wǒmen de diǎn shì shénme
It’s when family can’t understand our values

95
00:03:43,866 --> 00:03:46,933
旅游对我来说非常非常重要
lǚyóu duì wǒ lái shuō fēicháng fēicháng zhòngyào
Traveling is super important to me

96
00:03:46,933 --> 00:03:48,400
它可能是我
tā kěnéng shì wǒ
It may be my way of…

97
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:50,900
就是去看这个世界
jiùshì qù kàn zhège shìjiè
…seeing the world

98
00:03:50,900 --> 00:03:54,800
可能就是我人生最重要的事情
kěnéng jiùshì wǒ rénshēng zuì zhòngyào de shìqíng
It may be the most important thing in my life

99
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:56,733
然后我说妈妈
ránhòu wǒ shuō māma
Then I said, Mom

100
00:03:56,733 --> 00:03:58,466
我要去日本
wǒ yào qù Rìběn
I want to go to Japan

101
00:03:58,466 --> 00:04:00,833
然后妈妈说你不是去过了吗
ránhòu māma shuō nǐ bù shì qùguò le ma
Then my mom said, haven’t you already been?

102
00:04:00,833 --> 00:04:02,666
然后我说我要再去一次
ránhòu wǒ shuō wǒ yào zài qù yīcì
And I said, I want to go again

103
00:04:02,666 --> 00:04:05,033
对于中国人来说
duìyú Zhōngguó rén lái shuō
For Chinese people

104
00:04:05,033 --> 00:04:06,733
去一次就够了
qù yīcì jiù gòu le
Once is enough

105
00:04:06,733 --> 00:04:09,400
因为去一次你就已经可以跟别人说
yīnwèi qù yīcì nǐ jiù yǐjīng kěyǐ gēn biérén shuō
Because once you’ve been, you can already tell others

106
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,866
我去过这里
wǒ qùguò zhèlǐ
I’ve been there

107
00:04:10,866 --> 00:04:12,500
我做过这件事情
wǒ zuòguò zhè jiàn shìqing
I’ve done that thing

108
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:14,333
去一次就可以了
qù yīcì jiù kěyǐ le
Once is enough

109
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:16,433
是为了跟别人说的
shì wèile gēn biérén shuō de
It’s for telling others

110
00:04:16,433 --> 00:04:18,000
对你呢
duì nǐ ne
Right—and you?

111
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,800
你父母可以理解你旅游吗
nǐ fùmǔ kěyǐ lǐjiě nǐ lǚyóu ma
Can your parents understand your love for traveling?

112
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,800
我父母觉得我很可怜
wǒ fùmǔ juéde wǒ hěn kělián
My parents think I’m pitiful

113
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:26,866
就是说你为什么不住在同一个地方啊
jiùshì shuō nǐ wèishéme bù zhù zài tóng yī gè dìfāng a
Like, why don’t you just stay in one place?

114
00:04:26,866 --> 00:04:28,266
你怎么这么可怜
nǐ zěnme zhème kělián
Why do you live so pitifully?

115
00:04:28,266 --> 00:04:30,600
没有一个自己的家很不稳
méiyǒu yī gè zìjǐ de jiā hěn bù wěn
Not having your own home is so unstable

116
00:04:30,600 --> 00:04:31,466
他们不知道
tāmen bù zhīdào
They don’t realize

117
00:04:31,466 --> 00:04:33,466
这个是我自己的选择
zhè ge shì wǒ zìjǐ de xuǎnzé
This is my own choice

118
00:04:33,466 --> 00:04:36,233
就是我有过一个家
jiùshì wǒ yǒuguò yī gè jiā
I’ve had a home before

119
00:04:36,233 --> 00:04:38,000
然后我离开了
ránhòu wǒ líkāi le
Then I left it

120
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,333
这个是我的选择
zhè ge shì wǒ de xuǎnzé
This is my decision

121
00:04:39,333 --> 00:04:42,100
不是说我不能待在那里
bù shì shuō wǒ bù néng dāi zài nàlǐ
It’s not that I couldn’t stay there

122
00:04:42,100 --> 00:04:44,600
所以这个是一种生活方式
suǒyǐ zhè ge shì yī zhǒng shēnghuó fāngshì
So this is a lifestyle choice

123
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,033
她不能理解
tā bù néng lǐjiě
She just can’t understand

124
00:04:46,033 --> 00:04:49,933
比如说如果我是一个digital nomad对吧
bǐrú shuō rúguǒ wǒ shì yī gè digital nomad duì ba
Like if I’m a digital nomad, right?

125
00:04:49,933 --> 00:04:52,700
那我会在不同的国家住
nà wǒ huì zài bùtóng de guójiā zhù
Then I’ll live in different countries

126
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:55,033
对我来说这太好了
duì wǒ lái shuō zhè tài hǎo le
For me, that’s amazing

127
00:04:55,033 --> 00:04:57,500
哇我可以去这么多地方住
wā wǒ kěyǐ qù zhème duō dìfāng zhù
Wow, I can live in so many places

128
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,500
好像我有很多
hǎoxiàng wǒ yǒu hěn duō
It feels like I have many…

129
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:01,900
一辈子一辈子一辈子
yī bèizi yī bèizi yī bèizi
Lifetimes, lifetimes, lifetimes

130
00:05:01,900 --> 00:05:04,833
我有很多辈子的感觉
wǒ yǒu hěn duō bèizi de gǎnjué
I feel like I’ve lived many lives

131
00:05:04,833 --> 00:05:08,233
对那我妈妈就觉得哎
duì nà wǒ māma jiù juéde āi
But my mom would be like, sigh…

132
00:05:08,233 --> 00:05:11,466
你总是跑来跑去好累啊
nǐ zǒngshì pǎo lái pǎo qù hǎo lèi a
You’re always running around, it must be so tiring

133
00:05:11,466 --> 00:05:12,900
好可怜呐
hǎo kělián na
So pitiful

134
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:14,866
对但是不是这样的
duì dànshì bù shì zhèyàng de
Yeah, but it’s not like that

135
00:05:14,866 --> 00:05:17,833
他们可能不能理解的是这种生活
tāmen kěnéng bù néng lǐjiě de shì zhè zhǒng shēnghuó
They might not understand this kind of life

136
00:05:17,833 --> 00:05:19,833
我觉得很有意思
wǒ juéde hěn yǒuyìsi
I think it’s very interesting

137
00:05:19,833 --> 00:05:21,033
我们常常说
wǒmen chángcháng shuō
We often say

138
00:05:21,033 --> 00:05:24,866
我们发现我们的家人就是没苦硬吃
wǒmen fāxiàn wǒmen de jiārén jiùshì méi kǔ yìng chī
We realize our families are “addicted to hardship”

139
00:05:24,866 --> 00:05:27,266
比如说有一个东西已经坏了
bǐrú shuō yǒu yī gè dōngxi yǐjīng huài le
For example, something is already spoiled

140
00:05:27,266 --> 00:05:28,666
臭了发霉了
chòu le fāméi le
It smells bad and has gotten moldy

141
00:05:28,666 --> 00:05:29,866
我们知道不能吃
wǒmen zhīdào bù néng chī
We know we shouldn’t eat it

142
00:05:29,866 --> 00:05:31,300
但是家人会觉得
dànshì jiārén huì juéde
But family might think

143
00:05:31,300 --> 00:05:32,200
太浪费了吃吧
tài làngfèi le chī ba
It’s too wasteful, just eat it

144
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,200
然后吃了生病了
ránhòu chī le shēngbìng le
Then they eat it and get sick

145
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,533
然后去看医生
ránhòu qù kàn yīshēng
And go see the doctor

146
00:05:35,533 --> 00:05:36,900
然后浪费更多的钱
ránhòu làngfèi gèng duō de qián
And waste even more money

147
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:37,600
这样呢
zhèyàng ne
So that’s how it goes

148
00:05:37,600 --> 00:05:40,200
那我们就会觉得说这是没苦硬吃
nà wǒmen jiù huì juéde shuō zhè shì méi kǔ yìng chī
So we feel like that’s being addicted to hardship

149
00:05:40,200 --> 00:05:43,600
但可能我们的家人看我们跑来跑去
dàn kěnéng wǒmen de jiārén kàn wǒmen pǎo lái pǎo qù
But maybe our family sees us always moving around

150
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,466
也是觉得
yě shì juéde
And also thinks

151
00:05:44,466 --> 00:05:47,800
你可以在中国有非常安稳的生活
nǐ kěyǐ zài Zhōngguó yǒu fēicháng ānwěn de shēnghuó
You could have a very stable life in China

152
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:50,266
然后你就要跑来跑去
ránhòu nǐ jiù yào pǎo lái pǎo qù
But instead you want to run all over the place

153
00:05:50,266 --> 00:05:52,066
你也是没苦硬吃
nǐ yě shì méi kǔ yìng chī
So you’re also choosing unnecessary hardship

154
00:05:52,066 --> 00:05:56,066
所以可能一代人有一代人的没苦硬吃
suǒyǐ kěnéng yī dài rén yǒu yī dài rén de méi kǔ yìng chī
Maybe every generation has its own version of hardship addiction

155
00:05:56,066 --> 00:05:58,400
我觉得不是吧
wǒ juéde bù shì ba
I don’t think that’s it

156
00:05:58,400 --> 00:05:59,700
他们也不会
tāmen yě bú huì
They also wouldn’t

157
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:02,133
他们也不会觉得他们在吃苦
tāmen yě bú huì juéde tāmen zài chīkǔ
They wouldn’t even think they’re suffering

158
00:06:02,133 --> 00:06:03,100
这个是什么点
zhè ge shì shénme diǎn
So what is this point, exactly?

159
00:06:03,100 --> 00:06:04,433
Suqing就是
Suqing jiùshì
Suqing, it’s like…

160
00:06:04,433 --> 00:06:05,200
这个是什么
zhè ge shì shénme
What is this?

161
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,333
就是跑来跑去
jiùshì pǎo lái pǎo qù
It’s about moving around all the time

162
00:06:06,333 --> 00:06:08,200
就是有的人会觉得很累嘛
jiùshì yǒu de rén huì juéde hěn lèi ma
Some people think it’s really exhausting

163
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,266
然后就是你去一个新的地方
ránhòu jiùshì nǐ qù yī gè xīn de dìfāng
Like when you go somewhere new

164
00:06:10,266 --> 00:06:11,933
会有很多新的挑战
huì yǒu hěn duō xīn de tiǎozhàn
There are a lot of new challenges

165
00:06:11,933 --> 00:06:13,666
这个就是苦一种苦
zhè ge jiùshì kǔ yī zhǒng kǔ
And that’s a kind of hardship

166
00:06:13,666 --> 00:06:15,533
哇对我来说就是乐趣
wā duì wǒ lái shuō jiùshì lèqù
Wow, to me that’s joy!

167
00:06:15,533 --> 00:06:16,133
对我知道
duì wǒ zhīdào
Yes, I know

168
00:06:16,133 --> 00:06:17,333
对我来说也是啊
duì wǒ lái shuō yě shì a
It’s the same for me

169
00:06:17,333 --> 00:06:19,333
可是我家人有可能会在看我
kěshì wǒ jiārén yǒu kěnéng huì zài kàn wǒ
But my family might look at me

170
00:06:19,333 --> 00:06:23,800
会觉得她明明可以有很好的生活
huì juéde tā míngmíng kěyǐ yǒu hěn hǎo de shēnghuó
And think, she clearly could have a good life

171
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:27,233
然后可以在中国找一个有钱的老公
ránhòu kěyǐ zài Zhōngguó zhǎo yī gè yǒuqián de lǎogōng
She could marry a rich husband in China

172
00:06:27,233 --> 00:06:30,600
然后可以有一份很稳定的工作
ránhòu kěyǐ yǒu yī fèn hěn wěndìng de gōngzuò
And have a stable job

173
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,933
然后就会觉得说
ránhòu jiù huì juéde shuō
Then they’ll think

174
00:06:31,933 --> 00:06:34,900
为什么要去澳大利亚吃苦
wèishéme yào qù Àodàlìyà chīkǔ
Why would you go suffer in Australia?

175
00:06:34,900 --> 00:06:38,100
对
duì
Yeah

176
00:06:38,100 --> 00:06:42,600
但是后来我的爸爸妈妈也开始旅游了
dànshì hòulái wǒ de bàba māma yě kāishǐ lǚyóu le
But later, my parents started traveling too

177
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,500
我很高兴自己现在赚的钱比以前多
wǒ hěn gāoxìng zìjǐ xiànzài zhuàn de qián bǐ yǐqián duō
I’m happy that I earn more money now than before

178
00:06:45,500 --> 00:06:47,733
我可以给我父母更好的生活
wǒ kěyǐ gěi wǒ fùmǔ gèng hǎo de shēnghuó
I can give my parents a better life

179
00:06:47,733 --> 00:06:49,733
因为如果你没有过这样的生活
yīnwèi rúguǒ nǐ méiyǒu guò zhèyàng de shēnghuó
Because if you haven’t lived like this

180
00:06:49,733 --> 00:06:53,133
你很难想象
nǐ hěn nán xiǎngxiàng
It’s hard to imagine it

181
00:06:53,133 --> 00:06:54,233
对比如说我的父母从来不旅游
duì bǐrú shuō wǒ de fùmǔ cónglái bù lǚyóu
Yeah, for example, my parents never used to travel

182
00:06:54,233 --> 00:06:57,300
那我就想
nà wǒ jiù xiǎng
So I thought

183
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:59,300
如果他们也可以去吃我吃过的东西
rúguǒ tāmen yě kěyǐ qù chī wǒ chīguò de dōngxi
If they could eat what I’ve eaten

184
00:06:59,300 --> 00:07:02,266
看我看过的风景
kàn wǒ kànguò de fēngjǐng
See the sights I’ve seen

185
00:07:02,266 --> 00:07:04,500
去我去过的地方去感受
qù wǒ qùguò de dìfāng qù gǎnshòu
Feel the places I’ve experienced

186
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:06,700
他们会明白
tāmen huì míngbái
Then they would understand

187
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:09,666
他们可以知道
tāmen kěyǐ zhīdào
They’d come to know

188
00:07:09,666 --> 00:07:09,833
去看这个世界是什么样的
qù kàn zhège shìjiè shì shénme yàng de
What the world is really like

189
00:07:09,833 --> 00:07:14,200
我觉得他们现在也有一点点更加明白了
wǒ juéde tāmen xiànzài yě yǒu yīdiǎndiǎn gèngjiā míngbái le
I think they’re starting to understand a little more now

190
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:18,100
他们不太知道为什么要换地方
tāmen bù tài zhīdào wèishéme yào huàn dìfāng
They still don’t quite get why I move around

191
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:20,300
但是他们可以明白
dànshì tāmen kěyǐ míngbái
But they can understand that

192
00:07:20,300 --> 00:07:22,266
很多地方都不一样啊
hěn duō dìfāng dōu bù yīyàng a
Different places are really different

193
00:07:22,266 --> 00:07:23,500
很有意思
hěn yǒuyìsi
And very interesting

194
00:07:23,500 --> 00:07:25,833
Zhifei要不然我带你下车
Zhifei yào bùrán wǒ dài nǐ xiàchē
Zhifei, how about I drop you off?

195
00:07:25,833 --> 00:07:27,466
然后我们去吃韩国菜吧
ránhòu wǒmen qù chī Hánguó cài ba
Then let’s go eat Korean food

196
00:07:27,466 --> 00:07:29,033
好sorry
hǎo sorry
Okay—sorry

197
00:07:29,033 --> 00:07:30,100
就这样吧
jiù zhèyàng ba
Let’s just leave it at that

198
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:31,866
不知道等到什么时候
bù zhīdào děng dào shénme shíhòu
No idea when we’ll get around to it

199
00:07:31,866 --> 00:07:32,866
也不一定今天去
yě bù yīdìng jīntiān qù
Not necessarily today

200
00:07:32,866 --> 00:07:34,433
反正行啊
fǎnzhèng xíng a
Anyway, that’s fine

201
00:07:34,433 --> 00:07:38,233
所以不管是说去外国还是去旅游
suǒyǐ bùguǎn shì shuō qù wàiguó háishi qù lǚyóu
So whether it’s going abroad or traveling

202
00:07:38,233 --> 00:07:40,300
可能家人get不到
kěnéng jiārén “get” bù dào
Maybe our family just doesn’t get it

203
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:41,900
他们去尝试一次
tāmen qù chángshì yīcì
But once they try it

204
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,733
可能他们就能明白
kěnéng tāmen jiù néng míngbái
Maybe they’ll understand

205
00:07:43,733 --> 00:07:45,600
为什么我们这么喜欢
wèishéme wǒmen zhème xǐhuān
Why we love it so much

206
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:50,266
还有什么点是你父母get不到的
hái yǒu shénme diǎn shì nǐ fùmǔ “get” bù dào de
What else do your parents not understand?

207
00:07:50,266 --> 00:07:56,000
我觉得你刚才说的第三件事情是什么
wǒ juéde nǐ gāngcái shuō de dì sān jiàn shìqíng shì shénme
I think… what was that third thing you just mentioned?

208
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:59,466
我忘了是自由还是政府
wǒ wàng le shì zìyóu háishì zhèngfǔ
I forgot if it was about freedom or government

209
00:07:59,466 --> 00:08:01,300
很舒服
hěn shūfu
Very comfortable

210
00:08:01,300 --> 00:08:04,200
然后他们get不到
ránhòu tāmen “get” bù dào
And they don’t get it

211
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:09,900
就是你要是跟父母说我的
jiùshì nǐ yàoshi gēn fùmǔ shuō wǒ de
Like when you tell your parents something like

212
00:08:09,900 --> 00:08:12,233
这里办事很方便呐
zhèlǐ bànshì hěn fāngbiàn na
Things here are so efficient

213
00:08:12,233 --> 00:08:15,433
这里的公务员帮我
zhèlǐ de gōngwùyuán bāng wǒ
The public servants here helped me

214
00:08:15,433 --> 00:08:18,466
对那父母会觉得
duì nà fùmǔ huì juéde
Yeah—and the parents might think

215
00:08:18,466 --> 00:08:19,866
这个有什么
zhège yǒu shénme
So what?

216
00:08:19,866 --> 00:08:24,233
我已经习惯了中国的这个方式了
wǒ yǐjīng xíguàn le Zhōngguó de zhège fāngshì le
I’m already used to the way things work in China

217
00:08:24,233 --> 00:08:28,266
他们不知道有一些其他的方式
tāmen bù zhīdào yǒu yīxiē qítā de fāngshì
They don’t know there are other ways of doing things

218
00:08:28,266 --> 00:08:28,733
对
duì
Yeah

219
00:08:28,733 --> 00:08:32,033
我觉得在中国有一个比较体验不好的
wǒ juéde zài Zhōngguó yǒu yī gè bǐjiào tǐyàn bù hǎo de
I think one thing that’s not so pleasant in China

220
00:08:32,033 --> 00:08:35,033
是你去政府部门
shì nǐ qù zhèngfǔ bùmén
Is going to government offices

221
00:08:35,033 --> 00:08:36,266
去办东西
qù bàn dōngxi
To handle stuff

222
00:08:36,266 --> 00:08:39,033
然后有时候他们会很不专业
ránhòu yǒu shíhou tāmen huì hěn bù zhuānyè
And sometimes they’re really unprofessional

223
00:08:39,033 --> 00:08:41,133
然后有时候他们脾气不好
ránhòu yǒu shíhou tāmen píqì bù hǎo
And sometimes they have a bad attitude

224
00:08:41,133 --> 00:08:43,233
然后就会让你觉得说
ránhòu jiù huì ràng nǐ juéde shuō
And it makes you feel like

225
00:08:43,233 --> 00:08:44,200
如果他不帮我
rúguǒ tā bù bāng wǒ
If they don’t help me

226
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,833
没有人可以帮我
méiyǒu rén kěyǐ bāng wǒ
No one else can help me

227
00:08:45,833 --> 00:08:47,100
就只有他可以帮我
jiù zhǐyǒu tā kěyǐ bāng wǒ
Only that one person can help me

228
00:08:47,100 --> 00:08:49,033
我不可以让他生气
wǒ bù kěyǐ ràng tā shēngqì
I can’t afford to make them angry

229
00:08:49,033 --> 00:08:49,900
对不对
duì bù duì
Right?

230
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:52,033
然后这个让我觉得很烦
ránhòu zhège ràng wǒ juéde hěn fán
And that really annoys me

231
00:08:52,033 --> 00:08:52,866
我在澳大利亚
wǒ zài Àodàlìyà
When I’m in Australia

232
00:08:52,866 --> 00:08:53,400
我会觉得
wǒ huì juéde
I feel that

233
00:08:53,400 --> 00:08:56,466
在这一点上是我觉得很舒服的
zài zhè yīdiǎn shàng shì wǒ juéde hěn shūfu de
This is something I find very comforting

234
00:08:56,466 --> 00:08:59,000
就是他们只要把他们的工作做了
jiùshì tāmen zhǐyào bǎ tāmen de gōngzuò zuò le
They just need to do their job

235
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,066
对对对
duì duì duì
Yes, exactly

236
00:09:01,066 --> 00:09:03,200
在中国我也会觉得
zài Zhōngguó wǒ yě huì juéde
In China, I also feel

237
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:05,066
有时候有点怕医生
yǒu shíhou yǒudiǎn pà yīshēng
Sometimes I’m a bit afraid of doctors

238
00:09:05,066 --> 00:09:07,433
因为怕他跟我发脾气
yīnwèi pà tā gēn wǒ fā píqì
Because I’m afraid they’ll get angry at me

239
00:09:07,433 --> 00:09:10,066
或者对我态度不好
huòzhě duì wǒ tàidù bù hǎo
Or treat me badly

240
00:09:10,066 --> 00:09:12,200
而且人也很多
érqiě rén yě hěn duō
And there are a lot of people

241
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:14,866
你经常有一种不安全的感觉
nǐ jīngcháng yǒu yī zhǒng bù ānquán de gǎnjué
You often feel unsafe

242
00:09:14,866 --> 00:09:16,800
我吧我会觉得
wǒ ba wǒ huì juéde
As for me, I feel like

243
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,300
怎么办呢
zěnme bàn ne
What should I do?

244
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:21,466
又要去看医生好烦
yòu yào qù kàn yīshēng hǎo fán
Ugh, going to see a doctor again—so annoying

245
00:09:21,466 --> 00:09:25,333
这就是我们父母不理解我们的一些点
zhè jiùshì wǒmen fùmǔ bù lǐjiě wǒmen de yīxiē diǎn
These are some of the things our parents don’t understand about us

246
00:09:25,333 --> 00:09:28,400
对 然后你觉得为什么你的父母不理解呢
duì ránhòu nǐ juéde wèishéme nǐ de fùmǔ bù lǐjiě ne
Right, and why do you think your parents don’t understand you?

247
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,666
是因为
shì yīnwèi
Is it because…

248
00:09:29,666 --> 00:09:34,833
他们很难想象国外是什么样的
tāmen hěn nán xiǎngxiàng guówài shì shénme yàng de
They can’t imagine what life abroad is like

249
00:09:34,833 --> 00:09:37,833
还有就是你可以有选择
hái yǒu jiùshì nǐ kěyǐ yǒu xuǎnzé
And also that you actually have choices

250
00:09:37,833 --> 00:09:40,000
比如说不结婚
bǐrú shuō bù jiéhūn
Like not getting married

251
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,900
不生孩子
bù shēng háizi
Not having kids

252
00:09:41,900 --> 00:09:43,266
创业
chuàngyè
Starting your own business

253
00:09:43,266 --> 00:09:45,266
都是一种选择
dōu shì yī zhǒng xuǎnzé
All of those are valid choices

254
00:09:45,266 --> 00:09:46,900
因为我妈妈有时候说
yīnwèi wǒ māma yǒu shíhou shuō
Because my mom sometimes says

255
00:09:46,900 --> 00:09:49,233
你创业好辛苦啊
nǐ chuàngyè hǎo xīnkǔ a
Running your own business is so hard

256
